    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_identity",
      "statement": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. DED is 1,4-diethyl-1,4-diazabicyclo[2.2.2]octane dication, not a neutral diamine. Define A=TEA+BF4- and B=DED2+(BF4-)2 (both charge0 singlet). For each use one and two PC molecules in contact and separated configurations. PC is racemic; choose a fixed stereochemical composition and report it. Compare PC transfer A.PC+B -> A+B.PC and the corresponding second-PC exchange; compare contact/separated at equal solvent count. Source 1 M TEABF4 +0.2 M DED salt is experimental context, not a finite-cluster concentration.",
      "expected": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. DED is 1,4-diethyl-1,4-diazabicyclo[2.2.2]octane dication, not a neutral diamine. Define A=TEA+BF4- and B=DED2+(BF4-)2 (both charge0 singlet). For each use one and two PC molecules in contact and separated configurations. PC is racemic; choose a fixed stereochemical composition and report it. Compare PC transfer A.PC+B -> A+B.PC and the corresponding second-PC exchange; compare contact/separated at equal solvent count. Source 1 M TEABF4 +0.2 M DED salt is experimental context, not a finite-cluster concentration.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "source_main_si",
        "benchmark_design"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_equal_composition_clusters",
      "statement": "Keep correct anion count and PC count; separated structures may collapse, but only actual mapped optimization evidence establishes that fact. Core rows: TEA_PC1_contact, TEA_PC1_separated, TEA_PC2_contact, TEA_PC2_separated, DED_PC1_contact, DED_PC1_separated, DED_PC2_contact, DED_PC2_separated. Recompute electronic_Eh, G_Eh, ion_pair_distance_A from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
      "expected": "Keep correct anion count and PC count; separated structures may collapse, but only actual mapped optimization evidence establishes that fact. Core rows: TEA_PC1_contact, TEA_PC1_separated, TEA_PC2_contact, TEA_PC2_separated, DED_PC1_contact, DED_PC1_separated, DED_PC2_contact, DED_PC2_separated. Recompute electronic_Eh, G_Eh, ion_pair_distance_A from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
